{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL is an atmospheric narrative puzzler about hope, decay and the things we cannot fix. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/ezgif-5-8c61e53291.gif?t=1747032750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the shoes of a young scavenger, you'll set off on a journey across a strange continent that will take you over lonely archipelagos, ancient machine graveyards and barren wastelands - and eventually into the chaotic, bustling alleyways, seedy bars and towering skyscrapers of the last city at the end of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/phone.gif?t=1747032750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll repair, manipulate and fiddle with a varied range of mechanical and tactile puzzles to progress the story but also to unlock optional story elements. Every puzzle presents unique challenges but they all work on a shared logic. At first they will seem alien and opaque but as your understanding of these devices deepen, so will their complexity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/city.gif?t=1747032750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich in details, BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL utilises innovative graphical and visual rendering techniques to create a wholly unique look and experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2418040?t=1747032750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/82d4b3772d126566aec07d9c806cd96cdbac38ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747032750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ac922ec731ecf273ceff53e83a882a2c9027355f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747032750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ac922ec731ecf273ceff53e83a882a2c9027355f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747032750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL is an atmospheric narrative puzzler about hope, decay and the things we cannot fix. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/ezgif-5-8c61e53291.gif?t=1747032750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the shoes of a young scavenger, you'll set off on a journey across a strange continent that will take you over lonely archipelagos, ancient machine graveyards and barren wastelands - and eventually into the chaotic, bustling alleyways, seedy bars and towering skyscrapers of the last city at the end of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/phone.gif?t=1747032750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll repair, manipulate and fiddle with a varied range of mechanical and tactile puzzles to progress the story but also to unlock optional story elements. Every puzzle presents unique challenges but they all work on a shared logic. At first they will seem alien and opaque but as your understanding of these devices deepen, so will their complexity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/extras/city.gif?t=1747032750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich in details, BEYOND THE PLASTIC WALL utilises innovative graphical and visual rendering techniques to create a wholly unique look and experience.</p>","developers":["Motvind Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/f3e6c4af0e996a6c0107dd36f5ba097b078a9d15/header.jpg?t=1747032750","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"name":"Beyond The Plastic Wall","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Motvind Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ss_4e8a2d1de083456ebcefdafc01ff5ef6e7feb3d2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747032750","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ss_4e8a2d1de083456ebcefdafc01ff5ef6e7feb3d2.600x338.jpg?t=1747032750"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ss_c80b863e3d9a8fcf47ef5b3ff4d9c5f66f545816.1920x1080.jpg?t=1747032750","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ss_c80b863e3d9a8fcf47ef5b3ff4d9c5f66f545816.600x338.jpg?t=1747032750"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418040/ss_c06d3f7b7512b6de82775ee638775c263ceb9c35.1920x